      "summary": {
        "unit_id": "hmh07-lua-follow4:015",
        "answer": "Builds the MP ammo display, initializes tankState only if unset, and links CurrentWeapon into its four ammo children. OneInChamber and GoldenBullet are stored state conditions. After registering close, optional PreLoadFunc runs at the recovered late position, then the OIC child is replaced with a fake outside oic. Creates self via LUI.UIElement.new, Blur via LUI.UIImage.new, EnemyFlagHeld via CoD.AmmoWidgetMP_HeldItem.new, Backer via LUI.UIImage.new, PanelDark via LUI.UIImage.new, PanelLight via LUI.UIImage.new, AmmoWidgetOneInTheChamber via CoD.AmmoWidget_OneInTheChamber.new, Frame via LUI.UIImage.new, FrameGolden via LUI.UIImage.new, FrameGoldenGlow via LUI.UIImage.new, GlowWeapon via LUI.UIImage.new, WeaponAmmoCount via CoD.AmmoWidget_WeaponInfo.new, StockAmmoWidget via CoD.AmmoWidget_StockAmmo.new, StockAmmoWidget2 via CoD.AmmoWidget_StockAmmo.new, LEDgraph via LUI.UIImage.new, LEDsc [excerpt; exact source record identified separately]",
